{
  "id": "SprintPublish003",
  "name": "03 Approve, Publish and Report",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 03 · Approve, Publish and Report\n**Problem:** content gets made but nobody tracks what was approved or posted, and the owner has no weekly overview.\n\n**What happens**\n- **Approve button:** the calendar row becomes `APPROVED`. If a channel is configured (`PUBLISH_CHAT_ID`) the video is posted there and the row becomes `POSTED`. Otherwise the owner gets a copy-paste **posting kit** (caption and hashtags).\n- **Redo button:** the stored clips are deleted and the row becomes `REDO`, ready for new clips.\n- **Every Monday 9:00** (or `/report`): a summary of the last 7 days goes to the owner on Telegram.\n\nNothing is ever posted without a human tapping Approve.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "4f155936-0dac-5af1-bf44-86df18ef9222",
      "name": "Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -48,
        -176
      ]
    },
